    "sections": {
        "description": "Charity Elemento provides a structured design with features that help create an organised and informative website. It includes configurable homepage sections for highlighting projects, announcements, featured content, testimonials, and contact information. Responsive layouts ensure the website adapts to different screen sizes, while customizable colours, typography, menus, and widgets allow adjustments without editing theme files. The theme supports the block editor and integrates with commonly used page-building tools for flexible content creation. It includes options for adding banners, image galleries, logo uploads, social media icons, and footer content. Standard compatibility with plugins for forms, search engine optimisation, caching, and security allows additional functionality when required. Translation-ready files make it easier to create multilingual websites, while built-in customization settings help maintain consistent styling throughout the site. The code is developed using current coding standards to support long-term maintenance and compatibility with newer platform updates. Users can modify layouts, spacing, and visual elements through the Customizer, making it possible to tailor the appearance while preserving a consistent and organised website structure."
    },
